 "regions": [
  {
   "id": "r2",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Readings in Bohlen (p. 22), occurs in one of the MSS. of these",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "S'atakas. All these may be thrown aside in the present inquiry",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "because, in the works where they occur, they do not claim to be",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "original Stanzas of the authors of those works. But the ques-",
     "end": "hyphen"
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "tion of difficulty is raised by Stanzas 70 and 27 of the Nîti-",
     "end": "hyphen"
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "s'ataka, by Miscellaneous Stanza 7 of the same S'ataka, and by",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "Miscellaneous Stanza 9 of the Vairâgyas'ataka.[*] The first of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 8,
     "text": "these, as is well known, is in the S'âkuntala; the second and",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 9,
     "text": "",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 10,
     "text": "third are in the Mudrârâkshasa; the fourth is in the Mṛichchha-",
     "end": "hyphen"
    },
    {
     "n": 11,
     "text": "",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 12,
     "text": "kaṭika.[†] Of these again the last two may be dismissed with the",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 13,
     "text": "",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 14,
     "text": "observation that as they are not to be found in all the copies of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 15,
     "text": "the S'atakas,[‡]—and as they are found elsewhere—they are pro-",
     "end": "hyphen"
    },
    {
     "n": 16,
     "text": "bably interpolated in the S'atakas. As to the second Stanza, it",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 17,
     "text": "must be observed, on the one hand, that it does not occur in one",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 18,
     "text": "of the three families[§] of MSS. consulted; but it is noticeable",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 19,
     "text": "",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 20,
     "text": "on the other hand that it is quoted as from Bhartṛihari's",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 21,
     "text": "S'ataka in so old a work as the Das'arûpâvaloka[¶]—which work",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 22,
     "text": "also quotes in another place the Mudrârâkshasa,[‖] in which the",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 23,
     "text": "Stanza occurs again. However, as the question is distinctly",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 24,
     "text": "raised by the first noted Stanza (which does not occur only in",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 25,
     "text": "an imperfect copy), we need not dwell here any longer on this",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 26,
     "text": "part of the matter.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "id": "r3",
   "type": "footnote",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "* Bohlen also mentions Bhavabhûti, but I am not aware of any Stanza",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "common to him with Bhartṛihari. Is there not some mistake when",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "Bohlen speaks of a codex of the Sâhitya Darpaṇa as written in 1027 A.",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "C.? See Præfatio p. 6.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "id": "r4",
   "type": "footnote",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "† For references see our Notes to the respective Stanzas.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "id": "r5",
   "type": "footnote",
   "lines": [
